atisfaction.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li>\n    <li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "exp2_bullets": "", "exp3_bullets": ""}, "clHtml": "<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Hiring Manager at United,</p>\n<p>I am writing to apply for the Senior Analyst - Finance Data Capability role at United. With over five years of hands-on experience building reliable SQL and Python reporting pipelines, designing executive Tableau dashboards, and partnering with product and operations leaders, I am eager to contribute immediately to United's data and analytics goals.</p>\n<p>Throughout my career across high-volume operational and business intelligence environments, I have focused on turning complex, fragmented datasets into clear, trustworthy decision frameworks. Whether automating recurring ETL workflows or establishing governed KPI definitions across teams, I prioritize data accuracy and practical business impact.</p>\n<p>In my recent work, I re-engineered manual reporting workflows into automated SQL and Tableau pipelines that reduced reporting latency by over 40% while uncovering key drivers of funnel conversion and SLA performance. This blend of technical execution and stakeholder communication aligns closely with what United seeks in this position.</p>\n<p>I thrive in fast-paced environments where requirements evolve quickly and cross-functional clarity is essential. My background spans end-to-end requirement gathering, UAT governance, root-cause diagnostics, and translating technical findings for non-technical leadership.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in SQL, Python, Tableau, and business analysis can support United's upcoming initiatives.</p>"}, {"sNo": "10", "sNoNum": 10, "resumeId": "RES-10", "company": "United", "industry": "Airlines", "jobId": "Job IdGGN00002647", "title": "Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator", "jd": "Description\nJob Overview and Responsibilities\n\nThe Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator plays a critical role in maintaining the integrity and accuracy of catering data across United\u2019s systems and tools. This position supports business partners in delivering seamless catering services for flights systemwide through meticulous data management, system administration, and process optimization.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n\u2022 Data Management & Quality Assurance: Enter, verify, and maintain accurate catering data in United\u2019s management systems, ensuring timely updates with the precision required to support operational excellence\n\n\u2022 System Architecture & Configuration: Design and build system framework and codes to optimize service scheduling and ensure accurate vendor payments across the catering network\n\n\u2022 Data Integrity & Error Resolution: Conduct comprehensive data audits, identify inconsistencies, and collaborate with stakeholders to resolve issues while maintaining the highest standards of data quality\n\n\u2022 Technical Issue Resolution: Serve as a liaison between internal and external stakeholders to report, monitor, and resolve technical challenges efficiently\n\n\u2022 Process Improvement: Develop and implement scalable process enhancements that drive operational efficiency and organizational agility\n\n\u2022 Systems Administration: Oversee system setup, maintenance, vendor access management, and corporate compliance requirements\n\n\u2022 Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner with diverse teams and external vendors to support ad-hoc projects and ensure operational accuracy\n\n \n\nThis position is offered on local terms and conditions.  Expatriate assignments and sponsorship for employment visas, even on a time-limited visa status, will not be awarded. This position is for United Airlines Business Services Pvt. Ltd - a wholly owned subsidiary of United Airlines Inc.\n\n \n\nQualifications\nQualifications\n\nRequired Qualifications:\n\n\u2022 Bachelor\u2019s degree in Hospitality, Business Administration, or related field\n\n\u2022 3+ years of experience in data entry and administrative support for large-scale teams and systems\n\n\u2022 Exceptional attention to detail and accuracy\n\n\u2022 Strong analytical and data management capabilities\n\n\u2022 Proven ability to work effectively across multiple stakeholder groups\n\n\u2022 Self-motivated with the ability to work independently in a remote environment\n\n\u2022 Excellent written and verbal communication skills\n\n\u2022 Solution-oriented mindset with strong problem-solving abilities\n\n\u2022 Legal authorization to work in India without sponsorship requirements\n\n\u2022 Fluency in English (written and spoken)\n\n\u2022 Ability to lead projects\n\nPreferred Qualifications:\n\n\u2022 Advanced degree or specialization in Hospitality, Catering/Food Services, or Airline Industry\n\n\u00b7  Experience using AI tools like Copilot, Gemini etc.\n\n\u2022 Technical proficiency in SQL and Python\n\n\u2022 Knowledge of airport or airline catering operations\n\n\u2022 Experience with continuous improvement methodologies\n\n\u2022 Familiarity with enterprise management systems (Oracle, CAE, Coupa, SAP, etc.)", "location": "Gurugram, Haryana, India", "portal": "Company site", "jdUrl": "https://careers.united.com/us/en/c/corporate-jobs", "status": "Applied", "stageBucket": "Applied", "resumeStatus": "Ready for Review", "clStatus": "Ready for Review", "combinedDocStatus": "To be reviewed", "appliedOn": "8/25/2026", "followUpDate": "", "createdOn": "8/25/2026 09:00 IST", "lastUpdated": "2026-10-07 15:15 IST", "reference": "", "hrName": "", "hrEmail": "", "hrPhone": "", "reviewerNotes": "", "clNotes": "", "generalNotes": "", "aboutCompany": "Major global airline operating Digital Technology & Analytics center in Gurugram.", "resumeDriveId": "1cZCb1EHf82miILMVWTs6AKs9hgxClrGm", "resumeLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "resumePreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clDriveId": "1w2tObZiTq_cVcexsvJh3fwrAY_3mNDYV", "clLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clPreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "roleCategory": "operations_strategy", "extractedKeywords": "[object Object]", "revisionCount": 1, "clRevisionCount": 1, "resumeSections": {"summary_html": "<p>Senior Data &amp; Business Analyst combining extensive enterprise data analytics and operations intelligence experience with a strong foundation in commercial strategy and stakeholder consulting. Proven track record of architecting automated data pipelines and interactive KPI reporting suites using <strong>SQL, Python, and Tableau</strong> to streamline reporting workflows, resolve operational bottlenecks, and elevate cross-functional delivery quality. Adept at applying <strong>data cleaning and transformation</strong> and <strong>diagnostic root-cause analysis</strong> to translate complex datasets into clear executive presentations and actionable business decisions.</p>", "skills_html": "<ul>\n  <li><strong>Data Analysis &amp; Database Management:</strong> SQL (Postgresql, Mysql, Bigquery), Python (Pandas, Numpy), Excel, Api/data Integration, Database Management, R, Jupyter Notebooks</li>\n  <li><strong>Business Intelligence &amp; Visualization:</strong> Dashboard/report Automation, KPI Scorecard Design, Tableau, Interactive Dashboards, Executive Presentations, Narrative Insight Synthesis</li>\n  <li><strong>Data Governance &amp; Process Optimization:</strong> Quality Assurance, Data Cleaning &amp; Wrangling, Data Transformation, Identifying Improvement Opportunities, Automating Workflows (n8n), Root-cause &amp; Variance Analysis</li>\n  <li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration &amp; Strategy:</strong> Critical Thinking &amp; Problem Solving, Stakeholder Communication, Cross-functional Teamwork, Business Acumen, Consulting &amp; Client Engagement, Training &amp; Mentorship</li>\n</ul>", "experience_html": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Spearheaded end-to-end <strong>SQL data modelling</strong> and pipeline optimization across 1M+ monthly records using Python and BigQuery, cutting manual reporting overhead by 40%.</li>\n    <li>Designed and deployed interactive <strong>Tableau dashboards</strong> and automated KPI reporting suites across 15+ cross-functional launches, accelerating leadership decision cycles.</li>\n    <li>Conducted deep-dive <strong>root-cause analysis</strong> and customer segmentation across multi-source datasets, partnering with engineering and business teams to maintain 95% delivery quality.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Built automated <strong>performance analytics</strong> trackers and Excel/SQL competency matrices across 200+ specialists, boosting new-hire quality scores by 84% within two quarters.</li>\n    <li>Led <strong>diagnostic gap analysis</strong> on operational SLA and quality telemetry, redesigning process workflows to reduce recurring knowledge and execution gaps by 30%.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with global operations stakeholders on <strong>capacity planning</strong> and workflow standardization, driving a 25% increase in team productivity and throughput.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Customer Support Representative, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Jan 2021 \u2013 Mar 2022</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Resolved escalated consumer inquiries by utilizing <strong>CRM telemetry</strong> and historical performance metrics, accelerating ticket resolution speed by 35% across high-volume queues.</li>\n    <li>Analyzed user interaction trends to identify recurring <strong>service bottlenecks</strong>, partnering with operations leads to streamline workflows and boost customer satisfaction.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li>\n    <li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Project Management</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<p class=\"salutation\"><strong>To the Hiring Team at United,</strong></p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>What caught my attention about the <strong>Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator</strong> role at United is how directly it addresses the behind-the-scenes precision required to keep a massive operational network moving. Ensuring accurate data, vendor payments, and seamless system configurations across flight catering requires an analytical eye that respects how small data errors compound at scale. Having spent the last several years turning messy operational workflows into clean data models and structured BI\u2014preceded by a decade running my own commercial operations and B2B sales\u2014I know that logistical reliability lives or dies in the details of the database.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>When I am not writing <strong>SQL</strong> queries, mapping workflows, or auditing data consistency, I spend my spare time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating personal workflows with <strong>n8n</strong>. Cultivating mushrooms in North India's climate is an exercise in strict variable control\u2014if humidity, airflow, or substrate prep drifts even slightly, the batch fails. I bring that exact same practical stewardship to enterprise systems, whether I am managing <strong>data integrity and error resolution</strong>, configuring system frameworks, or ensuring meticulous accuracy in daily operations.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>Furthermore, I believe data management is only as useful as the operational alignment it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new training cohorts, and simply sending leadership another dashboard wasn\u2019t solving it. I dug into the recruitment funnel, traced the disconnect between screening and floor realities, and successfully advocated to embed our training team directly into the hiring workflow\u2014a structural shift that drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>. I apply that same cross-functional problem-solving today at Highspring India, partnering across <strong>4+ engineering and business groups</strong> to cut manual reporting overhead by 40% and resolve hundreds of data consistency gaps.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>While my technical foundation across SQL, Python, and data governance is robust, I understand that adapting to proprietary airline and catering management architectures requires a steep learning curve on day one. Early in my career, navigating real-world constraints taught me how to strip away noise, focus on fundamentals, and become a <strong>dedicated learner with a sharp focus</strong> on operational excellence. Above all, I am <strong>unconditionally dependable</strong>\u2014when I take ownership of a system or dataset, you will never have to chase me to see it through.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would value the chance to bring this grounded ownership, rigorous attention to detail, and steady execution to your team at United.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience can support your upcoming data and systems initiatives.</p>"}, "index": 10, "role": "Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator", "category": "operations_strategy", "jobUrl": "https://careers.united.com/us/en/c/corporate-jobs", "jdSnippet": "Description\nJob Overview and Responsibilities\n\nThe Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator plays a critical role in maintaining the