plift in promotional conversion rates.</li>\n    <li>Translated complex consumer datasets into actionable marketing strategies, ensuring robust alignment with client business objectives.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Microsoft Certified: Power BI Data Analyst Associate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">Dec 2024</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<div class=\"letter-meta\">\n  <div class=\"letter-date\">September 29, 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"recipient-block\">\n    <div>Shraddha Verma</div>\n    <div>Damco</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subject-line\"><strong>Re: Application for Business Analytics</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Shraddha Verma,</p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>I am writing to apply for the Business Analytics role at Damco. What stood out to me in the job description is the focus on turning user data into clear reports that guide product decisions. Before spending the last five years in data analytics, I ran my own small marketing agency for ten years. That mix taught me how much time teams lose when numbers do not match across different tools. Fixing those gaps between business teams and engineering is the part of the job I enjoy most.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>Outside of writing SQL queries and building Tableau dashboards, I spend my free time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating small daily tasks with n8n. Growing mushrooms in North India weather is not a fancy hobby. It comes down to watching basic details closely. If moisture or airflow slips even a little, the whole batch fails. I bring that same habit to my work when I check data quality, map workflows, or build reports that leaders rely on.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>I also believe analysis is only useful when it solves a real problem on the ground. At Concentrix, our hiring data showed that new joiners were struggling once they started work. Sending another dashboard to management was not fixing the issue. I looked closely at the hiring steps and worked with leadership to bring our training team directly into the interview stage. That simple change improved hire quality by 84 percent. In my current role at Highspring India, I use the same practical approach across four engineering teams to automate recurring reports and cut manual work by 40 percent.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>My day-to-day work covers SQL, Python, Tableau, and working closely with business and tech teams. If your team uses an internal tool I have not worked with yet, I learn new systems quickly. Practical challenges early in my career taught me how to stay resourceful, focus on the basics, and get things done without hand-holding. When I take ownership of a task, you will not have to follow up twice.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would welcome the chance to bring this steady and practical approach to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration, and I look forward to speaking with you soon.</p>"}, "index": 13, "role": "Business Analytics", "category": "product_business_analytics", "jobUrl": "https://www.damcogroup.com/careers", "jdSnippet": "Job Summary:\nWe are looking for a strong analytics professional with expertise in Product Analytics, Business Analytics, or Data Analytics. The role will involve working with large-scale product and user data to understand user behavior, generate actionable insights, build scalable dashboards, and influence product and business decisions.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\nDesign, build, and maintain dashboards and reports using Tableau / Tableau.\nAnalyze product usage, feature adoption, funnels, cohorts, and business KPIs.\nConduct deep-dive and root-cause analysis to identify trends, anomalies, and performance drivers.\nDefine and evolve product success metrics and KPIs.\nPartner with Product Managers, Engineers, Product Marketing, GTM, and Finance teams.\nSupport product roadmap decisions, feature evaluation, launches, adoption, and business impact analysis.\nDesign and analyze A/B tests and experiments, including hypothesis definition, metric selection, and statistical evaluation.\nTranslate complex data into clear insights and actionable recommendations.\nOwn analytical initiatives end-to-end, from problem definition through delivery and follow-through.\nRequired Skills:\n\n5+ years of experience in Product Analytics, Business Analytics, or Data Analytics.\nExpert-level SQL \u2014 complex joins, CTEs, window functions, and performance tuning.\nHands-on experience with large-scale data platforms such as Azure Databricks.\nStrong proficiency in Tableau / Tableau.\nGood understanding of statistics, experimentation, and analytical methodologies.\nWorking knowledge of Python or R for analysis, automation, or advanced analytics.\nStrong stakeholder management, communication, and data storytelling skills.\nCandidates should have strong analytical thinking and experience working in ambiguous problem statements.", "lastUpdate": "2026-10-06 09:00 IST", "referralName": "Shraddha Verma", "referralContact": "user@example.com", "referralStatus": "", "resumeFileId": "1c__I5AZGvGlj2l2ys9x-GPILa17_uFyq", "resumeUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clFileId": "1Q7tauc5dUNIDCOR98nFY6J6Mugjhtb5A", "clUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "sections": {"summary": "<p>Product Analytics professional leveraging <strong>SQL, Python, and Google Cloud Platform</strong> to decode user behavior and drive strategic growth. Expert in analyzing feature adoption and designing scalable Tableau dashboards that guide business KPIs. Proven success in cross-functional <strong>stakeholder management</strong> to translate complex large-scale data into actionable product decisions.</p>", "skills_html": "<ul>\n  <li><strong>Business Intelligence & Visualization:</strong> Tableau, Dashboard/Report Automation, Interactive Dashboards</li>\n  <li><strong>Data Analysis & Database Management:</strong> Python (Pandas, NumPy), PostgreSQL, MySQL, BigQuery, R, Excel, Jupyter Notebooks</li>\n  <li><strong>Reporting & Data Governance:</strong> Narrative Insight Synthesis, Executive Presentations, Data Cleaning, Wrangling, Transformation, Quality Assurance, API/Data Integration, Automating Workflows, Identifying Improvement Opportunities</li>\n  <li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration & Soft Skills:</strong> Communication, Consulting, Cross-Functional Teamwork, Training, Critical Thinking, Problem Solving, Client Engagement, Business Acumen</li>\n</ul>", "exp1_bullets": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Analyzed complex <strong>product usage</strong> data to track user behavior and streamline automated pipelines, reducing manual overhead by 40% across workflows.</li>\n    <li>Executed <strong>A/B testing</strong> protocols using Python and LLM for 15+ high-priority product launches, ensuring strict reliability prior to deployment.</li>\n    <li>Managed cross-functional <strong>stakeholder management</strong> across 4+ engineering groups to guide strategic business KPIs, maintaining project quality of 95%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Evaluated workforce metrics via <strong>Google Cloud Platform</strong> to decode key performance drivers, successfully improving hire quality by 84%.</li>\n    <li>Designed interactive <strong>Tableau</strong> dashboards to monitor upskilling project assessments, increasing operational team productivity by 25%.</li>\n    <li>Measured user <strong>feature adoption</strong> trends across learning platforms to identify operational gaps, optimizing overall training delivery by 30%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Conducted market research and <strong>business analytics</strong> to track audience engagement for Wild Vitamin Drink, increasing regional brand awareness by 45%.</li>\n    <li>Analyzed campaign performance metrics for Delhi Daredevils to evaluate fan engagement, driving a 30% uplift in promotional conversion rates.</li>\n    <li>Translated complex consumer datasets into actionable marketing strategies, ensuring robust alignment with client business objectives.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "exp2_bullets": "", "exp3_bullets": ""}, "clHtml": "<div class=\"letter-meta\">\n  <div class=\"letter-date\">September 29, 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"recipient-block\">\n    <div>Shraddha Verma</div>\n    <div>Damco</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subject-line\"><strong>Re: Application for Business Analytics</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Shraddha Verma,</p>\n<p>I am writing to apply for the Business Analytics role at Damco. What stood out to me in the job description is the focus on turning user data into clear reports that guide product decisions. Before spending the last five years in data analytics, I ran my own small marketing agency for ten years. That mix taught me how much time teams lose when numbers do not match across different tools. Fixing those gaps between business teams and engineering is the part of the job I enjoy most.</p>\n<p>Outside of writing SQL queries and building Tableau dashboards, I spend my free time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating small daily tasks with n8n. Growing mushrooms in North India weather is not a fancy hobby. It comes down to watching basic details closely. If moisture or airflow slips even a little, the whole batch fails. I bring that same habit to my work when I check data quality, map workflows, or build reports that leaders rely on.</p>\n<p>I also believe analysis is only useful when it solves a real problem on the ground. At Concentrix, our hiring data showed that new joiners were struggling once they started work. Sending another dashboard to management was not fixing the issue. I looked closely at the hiring steps and worked with leadership to bring our training team directly into the interview stage. That simple change improved hire quality by 84 percent. In my current role at Highspring India, I use the same practical approach across four engineering teams to automate recurring reports and cut manual work by 40 percent.</p>\n<p>My day-to-day work covers SQL, Python, Tableau, and working closely with business and tech teams. If your team uses an internal tool I have not worked with yet, I learn new systems quickly. Practical challenges early in my career taught me how to stay resourceful, focus on the basics, and get things done without hand-holding. When I take ownership of a task, you will not have to follow up twice.</p>\n<p>I would welcome the chance to bring this steady and practical approach to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration, and I look forward to speaking with you soon.</p>"}, {"sNo": "14", "sNoNum": 14, "resumeId": "RES-14", "company": "7-Eleven Global Solution Center", "industry": "IT service", "jobId": "10576", "title": "Data Analyst", "jd": "Role Summary:\n\nThe Analyst provides foundational analytics support across 7-Eleven\u2019s retail categories, enabling fact-based decisions for Merchandising and Category Management. This role is critical in building accurate reporting, validating data, and delivering baseline insights that fuel category growth and efficiency.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n\u00b7 Develop and maintain standardized reports/dashboards on sales, promotions, assortment, and vendor performance across categories.\n\n\u00b7 Ensure high-quality, accurate, and timely delivery of recurring reports and ad-hoc requests.\n\n\u00b7 Support pricing, promotion, and assortment analytics with initial insights and recommendations.\n\n\u00b7 Collaborate with senior team members to prepare inputs for category reviews and strategy decks.\n\n\u00b7 Maintain and improve data sources, trackers, and automation tools to drive efficiency.\n\nAttributes:\n\n\u00b7 Strong attention to detail with ability to validate and reconcile data across systems.\n\n\u00b7 Proficiency in Excel, SQL, and BI tools (Tableau preferred).\n\n\u00b7 Curiosity to learn the retail business model and eagerness to grow in analytics.", "location": "Bengaluru", "portal": "Company site", "jdUrl": "https://careers.7-eleven.com", "status": "Applied", "stageBucket": "Applied", "resumeStatus": "Approved & Learned", "clStatus": "Ready for Review", "combinedDocStatus": "LGTM", "appliedOn": "9/25/2026", "followUpDate": "9/28/2026", "createdOn": "9/25/2026 09:00 IST", "lastUpdated": "2026-10-06 09:00 IST", "reference": "", "hrName": "Kankona Roy", "hrEmail": "", "hrPhone": "", "reviewerNotes": "1. Remove Tableau from the summary and skills section\n2. Use Title case for skills section.", "clNotes": "", "generalNotes": "", "aboutCompany": "Global capability center powering analytics, merchandising & technology for 7-Eleven.", "resumeDriveId": "1crxNnmR66UfyRlQwdGD7zJK0k2GL755d", "resumeLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "resumePreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clDriveId": "10Vh4hV9ywuegQYUVdJmTUgD-GlWjLgac", "clLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clPreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "roleCategory": "retail_data_analyst", "extractedKeywords": "[object Object]", "revisionCount": 2, "clRevisionCount": 1, "resumeSections": {"summary_html": "<p>Data Analyst combining hands-on retail analytics experience at Highspring and Concentrix to optimize <strong>category management</strong> and merchandising strategies. Adept at building automated <strong>reporting & dashboards</strong> in Tableau and Excel to monitor vendor performance and pricing. Proven track record of leveraging <strong>SQL-driven insights</strong> to streamline inventory decisions and accelerate retail category growth.</p>", "skills_html": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Data Analysis And Database Management:</strong> Excel, PostgreSql, Mysql, Python, Pandas, Numpy, R, Bigquery, Api And Data Integration, Jupyter Notebooks</li>\n<li><strong>Business Intelligence And Reporting:</strong> Tableau, Dashboard And Report Automation, Interactive Dashboards, Narrative Insight Synthesis, Executive Presentations</li>\n<li><strong>Process Optimization And Governance:</strong> Data Cleaning, Wrangling, Transformation, Quality Assurance, Automating Workflows, Identifying Improvement Opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration And Soft Skills:</strong> Communication, Cross-Functional Teamwork, Consulting, Training, Client Engagement, Business Acumen, Critical Thinking, Problem Solving</li>\n</ul>", "experience_html": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Engineered interactive <strong>reporting & dashboards</strong> using <strong>Tableau</strong> and <strong>SQL</strong> to monitor vendor performance and pricing, cutting manual overhead by 40%.</li>\n    <li>Optimized category management analytics by executing <strong>data validation</strong> protocols across 15+ high-priority product launches to ensure strict pricing & promotion reliability.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with 4+ cross-functional retail groups to deploy <strong>automation tools</strong>, accelerating feature deployment velocity and maintaining project quality of 95%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Leveraged advanced <strong>Excel</strong> models and statistical techniques to analyze workforce datasets, improving hire quality by 84%.</li>\n    <li>Maintained stringent <strong>data governance</strong> standards by automating upskilling project assessments, increasing team productivity by 25%.</li>\n    <li>Delivered targeted operational insights through rigorous <strong>metrics tracking</strong>, successfully resolving critical knowledge gaps across internal stakeholder groups.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Executed comprehensive <strong>market research</strong> for Wild Vitamin Drink's website development, resulting in a 25% increase in HORECA sales.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with IPL stakeholders on merchandise sponsorship strategies, driving a 15% increase in fan merchandise sales through targeted promotions.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<p class=\"salutation\"><strong>Dear Kankona Roy and the Hiring Team at 7-Eleven Global Solution Center,</strong></p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>What caught my attention about the <strong>Data Analyst</strong> role at 7-Eleven Global Solution Center is how directly the job description addresses the day-to-day realities of retail merchandising and category management: turning disparate sales, promotion, and vendor data into reliable baseline insights. Having spent the last several years translating messy operational workflows into clean SQL models and production dashboards\u2014preceded by a decade of running my own commercial operations\u2014I know that category growth depends entirely on accurate reporting and disciplined data reconciliation. That practical middle ground between business execution and data integrity is where I do my best work.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>When I am not writing <strong>SQL</strong> queries, mapping datasets, or building <strong>Tableau</strong> reports, I spend my spare time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating personal workflows with n8n. Cultivating mushrooms in North India\u2019s climate isn\u2019t a romantic hobby; it is an exercise in strict variable control\u2014if humidity, airflow, or substrate prep drifts even slightly, the batch fails. I bring that same practical stewardship to the systems I manage at work, whether I am validating retail metrics across systems, maintaining complex data sources, or translating ambiguous business requests into <strong>accurate, standardized reports</strong>.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>Furthermore, I believe data analysis is only as useful as the operational fix it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new cohorts, and simply handing leadership another dashboard wasn't fixing the underlying issue. I dug into the recruitment funnel, traced the disconnect between initial screening and floor realities, and helped embed our training team directly into the hiring workflow, which drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>. I apply that same proactive rigor in my current role at Highspring India, partnering across multiple groups to profile 1M+ records, resolve data consistency issues, and cut manual reporting overhead by 40%.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>While my technical foundation covers strong ground across SQL, Python, BI reporting, and cross-functional data validation, I may not have hands-on experience with every specific proprietary system in your retail stack on day one. Early in my career, navigating real-world commercial and financial constraints taught me how to be resourceful, focus on fundamentals, and become a <strong>dedicated learner with a sharp focus</strong> on operational efficiency. Above all, I am unconditionally dependable\u2014when I take ownership of a deliverable, you will never have to chase me to see it through.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would value the chance to bring this grounded ownership, rigorous data validation, and steady execution to your merchandising and category management teams.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience can support your upcoming analytics initiatives.</p>"}, "index": 14, "role": "Data Analyst", "category": "retail_data_analyst", "jobUrl": "https://careers.7-eleven.com", "jdSnippet": "Role Summary:\n\nThe Analyst provides foundational analytics support across 7-Eleven\u2019s retail categories, enabling fact-based decisions for Merchandising and Category Management. This role is critical in building accurate reporting, validating data, and delivering baseline insights that fuel category growth and efficiency.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n\u00b7 Develop and maintain standardized reports/dashboards on sales, promotions, assortment, and vendor performance across categories.\n\n\u00b7 Ensure high-quality, accurate, and timely delivery of recurring reports and ad-hoc requests.\n\n\u00b7 Support pricing, promotion, and assortment analytics with initial insights and recommendations.\n\n\u00b7 Collaborate with senior team members to prepare inputs for category reviews and strategy decks.\n\n\u00b7 Maintain and improve data sources, trackers, and automation tools to drive efficiency.\n\nAttributes:\n\n\u00b7 Strong attention to detail with ability to validate and reconcile data across systems.\n\n\u00b7 Proficiency in Excel, SQL, and BI tools (Tableau preferred).\n\n\u00b7 Curiosity to learn the retail business model and eagerness to grow in analytics.", "lastUpdate": "2026-10-06 09:00 IST", "referralName": "Kankona Roy", "referralContact": "", "referralStatus": "", "resumeFileId": "1crxNnmR66UfyRlQwdGD7zJK0k2GL755d", "resumeUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clFileId": "10Vh4hV9ywuegQYUVdJmTUgD-GlWjLgac", "clUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "sections": {"summary": "<p>Data Analyst combining hands-on retail analytics experience at Highspring and Concentrix to optimize <strong>category management</strong> and merchandising strategies. Adept at building automated <strong>reporting & dashboards</strong> in Tableau and Excel to monitor vendor performance and pricing. Proven track record of leveraging <strong>SQL-driven insights</strong> to streamline inventory decisions and accelerate retail category growth.</p>", "skills_html": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Data Analysis And Database Management:</strong> Excel, PostgreSql, Mysql, Python, Pandas, Numpy, R, Bigquery, Api And Data Integration, Jupyter Notebooks</li>\n<li><strong>Business Intelligence And Reporting:</strong> Tableau, Dashboard And Report Automation, Interactive Dashboards, Narrative Insight Synthesis, Executive Presentations</li>\n<li><strong>Process Optimization And Governance:</strong> Data Cleaning, Wrangling, Transformation, Quality Assurance, Automating Workflows, Identifying Improvement Opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration And Soft Skills:</strong> Communication, Cross-Functional Teamwork, Consulting, Training, Client Engagement, Business Acumen, Critical Thinking, Problem Solving</li>\n</ul>", "exp1_bullets": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Engineered interactive <strong>reporting & dashboards</strong> using <strong>Tableau</strong> and <strong>SQL</strong> to monitor vendor performance and pricing, cutting manual overhead by 40%.</li>\n    <li>Optimized category management analytics by executing <strong>data validation</strong> protocols across 15+ high-priority product launches to ensure strict pricing & promotion reliability.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with 4+ cross-functional retail groups to deploy <strong>automation tools</strong>, accelerating feature deployment velocity and maintaining project quality of 95%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Leveraged advanced <strong>Excel</strong> models and statistical techniques to analyze workforce datasets, improving hire quality by 84%.</li>\n    <li>Maintained stringent <strong>data governance</strong> standards by automating upskilling project assessments, increasing team productivity by 25%.</li>\n    <li>Delivered targeted operational insights through rigorous <strong>metrics tracking</strong>, successfully resolving critical knowledge gaps across internal stakeholder groups.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Executed comprehensive <strong>market research</strong> for Wild Vitamin Drink's website development, resulting in a 25% increase in HORECA sales.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with IPL stakeholders on merchandise sponsorship strategies, driving a 15% increase in fan merchandise sales through targeted promotions.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "exp2_bullets": "", "exp3_bullets": ""}, "clHtml": "<p class=\"salutation\"><strong>Dear Kankona Roy and the Hiring Team at 7-Eleven Global Solution Center,</strong></p>\n<p>What caught my attention about the <strong>Data Analyst</strong> role at 7-Eleven Global Solution Center is how directly the job description addresses the day-to-day realities of retail merchandising and category management: turning disparate sales, promotion, and vendor data into reliable baseline insights. Having spent the last several years translating messy operational workflows into clean SQL models and production dashboards\u2014preceded by a decade of running my own commercial operations\u2014I know that category growth depends entirely on accurate reporting and disciplined data reconciliation. That practical middle ground between business execution and data integrity is where I do my best work.</p>\n<p>When I am not writing <strong>SQL</strong> queries, mapping datasets, or building <strong>Tableau</strong> reports, I spend my spare time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating personal workflows with n8n. Cultivating mushrooms in North India\u2019s climate isn\u2019t a romantic hobby; it is an exercise in strict variable control\u2014if humidity, airflow, or substrate prep drifts even slightly, the batch fails. I bring that same practical stewardship to the systems I manage at work, whether I am validating retail metrics across systems, maintaining complex data sources, or translating ambiguous business requests into <strong>accurate, standardized reports</strong>.</p>\n<p>Furthermore, I believe data analysis is only as useful as the operational fix it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new cohorts, and simply handing leadership another dashboard wasn't fixing the underlying issue. I dug into the recruitment funnel, traced the disconnect between initial screening and floor realities, and helped embed our training team directly into the hiring workflow, which drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>. I apply that same proactive rigor in my current role at Highspring India, partnering across multiple groups to profile 1M+ records, resolve data consistency issues, and cut manual reporting overhead by 40%.</p>\n<p>While my technical foundation covers strong ground across SQL, Python, BI reporting, and cross-functional data validation, I may not have hands-on experience with every specific proprietary system in your retail stack on day one. Early in my career, navigating real-world commercial and financial constraints taught me how to be resourceful, focus on fundamentals, and become a <strong>dedicated learner with a sharp focus</strong> on operational efficiency. Above all, I am unconditionally dependable\u2014when I take ownership of a deliverable, you will never have to chase me to see it through.</p>\n<p>I would value the chance to bring this grounded ownership, rigorous data validation, and steady execution to your merchandising and category management teams.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience can support your upcoming analytics initiatives.</p>"}, {"sNo": "15", "sNoNum": 15, "resumeId": "RES-14", "company": "7-Eleven Global Solution Center", "industry": "IT service", "jobId": "10623", "title": "Senior Data Analyst", "jd": "Experience: 5+ Years\n\nRole Purpose:\n\nAct as a trusted analytics partner to business stakeholders by delivering reporting, insights, and decision support while contributing to advanced analytics and Test & Learn initiatives. This is a highly hands-on techno-functional role requiring strong analytical capabilities, business acumen, storytelling skills, and proficiency in modern analytics tools.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\nDevelop and maintain executive dashboards, scorecards, KPI frameworks, and recurring business reporting solutions.\n\nConduct deep-dive analyses to identify business opportunities, risks, and performance drivers.\n\nPerform root cause analyses across sales, category performance, pricing, promotions, and operations.\n\nTranslate complex analytical findings into clear business recommendations and executive-ready presentations.\n\nSupport Test & Learn initiatives through measurement, impact assessment, and performance reporting.\n\nPartner with business stakeholders to define business requirements, frame analytical problems, and recommend solutions.\n\nBuild scalable reporting and analytical solutions using SQL, Tableau, Python, and Databricks.\n\nContribute to forecasting, statistical analysis, and advanced analytics projects as needed.\n\nMentor Associates and Analysts and support quality reviews across deliverables.\n\nRequired Skills\n\nSQL\n\nTableau\n\nPython\n\nAzure Databricks\n\nTest & Learn Analytics\n\nBusiness Storytelling\n\nStakeholder Management\n\nData Visualization\n\nRetail Analytics\n\nPreferred Background\n\n5+ years of experience in Retail Analytics, Business Analytics, or Reporting & Insights.\n\nStrong experience in dashboarding, reporting, and stakeholder-facing analytics.\n\nExposure to forecasting, statistical analysis, or advanced analytics projects.\n\nExperience supporting Test & Learn programs or business experimentation initiatives is preferred.\n\nDemonstrated ability to convert analysis into actionable business recommendations.", "location": "Bengaluru", "portal": "Company site", "jdUrl": "https://careers.7-eleven.com", "status": "Applied", "stageBucket": "Applied", "resumeStatus": "Ready for Review", "clStatus": "Ready for Review", "combinedDocStatus": "To be reviewed", "appliedOn": "9/25/2026", "followUpDate": "", "createdOn": "9/25/2026 09:00 IST", "lastUpdated": "2026-10-06 09:00 IST", "reference": "", "hrName": "", "hrEmail": "", "hrPhone": "", "reviewerNotes": "", "clNotes": "", "generalNotes": "", "aboutCompany": "Global capability center powering analytics, merchandising & technology for 7-Eleven.", "resumeDriveId": "1crxNnmR66UfyRlQwdGD7zJK0k2GL755d", "resumeLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "resumePreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clDriveId": "10Vh4hV9ywuegQYUVdJmTUgD-GlWjLgac", "clLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clPreviewUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "roleCategory": "retail_data_analyst", "extractedKeywords": "[object Ob