he operational fix it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new cohorts, and simply handing leadership another dashboard wasn't fixing the underlying issue. I dug into the recruitment funnel, traced the disconnect between initial screening and floor realities, and helped embed our training team directly into the hiring workflow, which drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>. I apply that same proactive rigor in my current role at Highspring India, partnering across multiple groups to profile 1M+ records, resolve data consistency issues, and cut manual reporting overhead by 40%.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>While my technical foundation covers strong ground across SQL, Python, BI reporting, and cross-functional data validation, I may not have hands-on experience with every specific proprietary system in your retail stack on day one. Early in my career, navigating real-world commercial and financial constraints taught me how to be resourceful, focus on fundamentals, and become a <strong>dedicated learner with a sharp focus</strong> on operational efficiency. Above all, I am unconditionally dependable\u2014when I take ownership of a deliverable, you will never have to chase me to see it through.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would value the chance to bring this grounded ownership, rigorous data validation, and steady execution to your merchandising and category management teams.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience can support your upcoming analytics initiatives.</p>"}, "index": 15, "role": "Senior Data Analyst", "category": "retail_data_analyst", "jobUrl": "https://careers.7-eleven.com", "jdSnippet": "Experience: 5+ Years\n\nRole Purpose:\n\nAct as a trusted analytics partner to business stakeholders by delivering reporting, insights, and decision support while contributing to advanced analytics and Test & Learn initiatives. This is 